+ residual + IA gate ($b{=}0$) & $0.505$ & $0.520$ & $0.393$ & $0.231$ & $0.210$ & $0.170$ & $0$ \\
+ cos + wd ($b{=}0$)         & $0.460$ & $0.398$ & $0.348$ & $\mathbf{0.194}$ & $0.190$ & $0.163$ & $2$ \\
+ linear raw ($b{=}0$)  & $0.436$ & $0.375$ & $0.325$ & $0.202$ & $0.193$ & $0.160$ & $1$\textsuperscript{$\star$} \\
+ $b{=}{-}2$                 & $0.432$ & $0.388$ & $0.331$ & $0.224$ & $0.191$ & $0.160$ & $1$\textsuperscript{$\star$} \\
